    \caption{Our studied problem setting. Given an unlabeled set $\gU$ and a fixed budget $B$, the goal is to select the $B$ most informative examples for annotation (set $\gL$), which are used to maximize ICL performance with an LLM $M$.  During ICL inference, a $k$-NN retriever based on a similarity space $\gS$ determines the $k$-shot demonstrations for each test instance.  
    }
